<item>
<title>人社部：要把未参保人员都找到“动员参保”人社部近日在国新办发布会上称，三项社保参保规模居全球首位，其中基本养老9月底达1</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10320</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10320</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 13:00:44 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>人社部：要把未参保人员都找到“动员参保”</b><br/><br/>人社部近日在国新办发布会上称，三项社保参保规模居全球首位，其中基本养老9月底达10.79亿人，但“现在还有一些人没有参保”，要通过“数据找人”等方式动员参保，力争“十五五”期间养老参保率稳定在95%以上。<br/><br/>他称重点是鼓励灵活就业人员、农民工和新就业形态人员参加职工养老保险，并建立用工方、平台企业和劳动者分担缴费的机制。<br/><br/>相关话题登上微博热搜。有博主指“灵活就业群体交房租、吃饭都把钱分完了，社保自然排后面”。据路透社7月报道指，非强制缴纳社保零工岗位激增，加剧了资金本就不足的社保所面临的长期风险。记者访问了12名灵活就业人员，只有2名愿意交社保，有受访者称：“我可以自己掌控，而不是苦等几十年让别人给我发钱”。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A">#社会</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%A4%BE%E4%BF%9D">#社保</a> <a href="?q=%23%E6%89%93%E5%B7%A5%E4%BA%BA">#打工人</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%83%AD%E6%90%9C">#热搜</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《新浪财经》<a href="https://finance.sina.com.cn/jjxw/2026-10-10/doc-iniutyyz2044159.shtml" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">人社部：要把未参保人员找到动员参保</a><br/>《新浪微博》<a href="https://www.sina.cn/news/detail/5352537697552192.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">数据找人交钱很重要，数据找人发钱也挺重要。</a><br/>《路透社》<a href="https://www.reuters.com/business/world-at-work/chinas-booming-gig-economy-masks-job-market-pain-strains-welfare-system-2026-07-06/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">China’s booming gig economy masks job market pain, strains welfare system</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/OmxVMjOxgZO1G0RsnkbPUUXWGDWLRvXwv_vrFnnma4ujLTp9mSs8LI8REyr3TvcpPO8DP4y0gq5AIBWUmolerYb42cSPFoZZTe8poLg-zIvCNX9yWpP6tGbex9uxirHl7nbM0ecHuY_kgRGSZlEyElWe4Ts8f1u8gF2kRoHFQsAbp3615LDWQQjDOd8EtZvhZJdqQmtKBGuekoO_w3jiRLGECrR03B73HBSoCcPzMiUy0K0z3-X6v3e_6ZxlzbYI6KvMq58w0idTwrs53jphUR0NxlB3rJkQ9PigVAMfffSIrxmVjl45F-Eb_34sKmhbPsbqp6n-QlGsjjM0k4y4jw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/O2jMXjWR0Tb0K5-835Vv-uObRlZNUJf3iOH9ydyMkFXOM5Ju7aH_9kuCcF9KG2JY-lM_hYmGP7Q5ri76NGLnoKYmTP07KJNs7IRSAJGe1GfnGoMJGYV3D3M5i2KwmteDLxU7jMJpN7DFnZJA1r6UaWeZuhVbHUWrL4q0xlk2kDXMdRZuUuIp9-sko_xUTtGgBLiROhDwk5k8jbOlHcE6yRXdUt_YpjnUaxvVeZdpuv3HZ7U3bsSpaVCfEZ-u-4zURJiVw5vs7_jCm9IkhRc2WzHs7NRFE1-B4lAW0uQrr69Stey7ss8QnwMLP8ccegUv9wFcdJiyFAd7TAyKJdJT6A.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/i-IrIYi03dFCt12gzLkZ6iqblk-PEIElToPucEm7EJIve0pHWLYZp-Gnsvb0DwetifvAJO324bikdnH1EC32HayUW_GeN_LNr1IP8g81S8L7Qip2IcaJvMHOstoYlVOq2VoJp7hE1lF__1sJlNP4LQkApfDBw91U8mTrPr2Lb1sy5KO_YO1oHOsw6UKplBEPUh6Iv_QPBkrVhFVRtDY8LW9MNHdVDcYVh0DzPkyl8yz78dyCPn_zAxb4JH7s1AOHuILlpDdJsDBvstfmTVUQIL1gyY3AViNOJA-VqLm_vlIaP9YOc7hqO4XcaMigLZ4CWjXr5QIdiOonjtvpBCV7iA.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/mXRKlIVsQQciY9TK2gLfobP0KqTuKJIRgOw_ucJzsJV0u0uMJ0T9sM4uIRwUePNe7DcMAihiCsRVejVlxGDlioVfpRqCgO8bB4lfxEn-I21IHx-aPXhyoU8i8TGcimQScTSeAohbptS3stu3dLnEmV2mD_xDZOqOlFzBYkAGDf7DRozZtSbRB9020z0Y19jV7Pq2C-avhIcM1WkKrU4l1Z0YHTjWa2rzmL4TUuyjWUFXL_y0245pkpqH1ymOPUfbyvE4sSUp8HWNsUUIFXkFnuOjNHul73WOgOGY9x0V3Hd4CSsAyBYWtLV5AAylSy_AkQzLbBi2r2c2hebOVwX4mQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A1.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FA4A3.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29DA4.png" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><im